WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:06,930
You're doing a great job and being a good mother.

2
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:10,110
Can I ask you something?

3
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:14,460
Can you help me take care of my child?

4
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:17,700
If you are worried

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,900
You can find a way to sign a contract

6
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,700
Either a master music contract or a low-level retail contract is acceptable.

7
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,700
As long as it can survive

8
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,530
I won’t sign Gu Shiyi

9
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:30,530
Don’t you know what a master’s contract and a retail contract are? To put it simply

10
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,930
I only think about life and death

11
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:35,260
He actually knows

12
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,740
I have been traveling since I was seven years old

13
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,540
Something that naturally knows the way

14
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,140
When I feel like I can't protect him anymore

15
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,140
I will let him go back to the mountain

16
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,140
Can you survive in the future?

17
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,140
It depends on his own ability

18
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:48,470
why

19
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,470
You don't have to believe it

20
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,920
But this is your last chance

21
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,720
Do you really believe him? Do you?

22
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,020
why

23
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:58,220
Is it just because he has no need to lie? Indeed?

24
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,420
What if he wants to do something

25
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,020
You can't stop me now

26
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,820
Because he is the same as us

27
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:05,420
We are all lonely beasts
